        }
      },
      "description": "One endpoint of the direct edge (CD-0227 D2): the source file and the entry point that owns the behavior. owner names the changed owner mechanism the dispatched job's allowance names; caller names the existing direct caller whose request behavior the repair preserves."
    },
    "caller_repair_checks": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "The three verification signals of one direct-caller repair (CD-0227 D2): the same exposing request passes on the baseline, fails with the owner change alone, and passes with the combined change. A compile-time break names the compile check in all three.",
      "required": [
